### 1. 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "管理员"
}

### 2. 登录（自动保存 Token 到 auth_token）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login?username=admin&password=123456

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data);
%}

### 3. 发布文章（需要登录，请确保数据库 category 表有 id=1 的数据）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/article/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "MyBatis-Plus 分页查询实战",
  "content": "本文介绍如何使用 MyBatis-Plus 实现多表关联分页查询...",
  "summary": "分页查询是后端开发必备技能",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "status": 1
}

### 4. 查询文章列表（分页，默认第一页，每页10条）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/list?page=1&size=10

### 5. 按标题关键词搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/list?page=1&size=5&keyword=分页

### 6. 按分类筛选（categoryId=1）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/list?page=1&size=5&categoryId=1

### 7. 按状态筛选（status=1 已发布）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/list?page=1&size=5&status=1

### 8. 组合筛选（分类 + 关键词 + 状态）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/list?page=1&size=5&categoryId=1&status=1&keyword=MyBatis

### 9. 查询单篇文章（编辑回显）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/1

### 10. 编辑文章（需要登录，注意修改 id 和 title）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/article/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "【已修改】MyBatis-Plus 分页查询实战（完善版）",
  "content": "这是修改后的内容，增加了更多细节...",
  "summary": "修改后的摘要",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "status": 1
}

### 11. 删除文章（需要登录，谨慎操作！）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/article/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 12. 发表顶级评论（需要登录）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comment/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 1,
  "content": "这篇文章写得很好，学习了！"
}

### 13. 回复某条评论（parentId 为评论ID，replyToUserId 为被回复者ID）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comment/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 1,
  "content": "感谢支持！欢迎继续交流。",
  "parentId": 1,
  "replyToUserId": 1
}

### 14. 查询文章的所有评论（按层级结构返回）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comment/list/1

### 15. 删除评论（需要登录，只能删自己的）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/comment/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 16. 点赞文章（需要登录）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/like/toggle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 17. 查看点赞状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/like/status/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 18. 查看点赞数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/like/count/1

### 19. 收藏文章
POST http://localhost:8080/api/like/collect/toggle/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 20. 查看收藏状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/like/collect/status/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 21. 查看收藏数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/like/collect/count/1

### 22. 发表空内容评论（应触发 @NotBlank 校验，返回 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comment/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 1,
  "content": ""
}